Package: myscoutee
Version: 1.0.0
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: MyScoutee <admin@myscoutee.local>
Depends: bash, coreutils
Recommends: docker.io, docker-compose-plugin, curl, jq, gnupg, openssl, ufw, ncdu, iotop, redis-tools
Description: MyScoutee production bundle
 Production packaging metadata for the MyScoutee Docker-based VPS deploy.
 The package is expected to install the application bundle, systemd unit,
 and operational helper scripts. Heavy dependency installation remains
 explicit in installer scripts instead of being hidden in application images.
